<PageTitle>Conditions of hire · Harbour Lane Community Centre</PageTitle>

<h1>Conditions of hire</h1>

<h2>Booking and paying</h2>
<p>A booking is confirmed when you receive its reference. Rooms are paid for by the hour, on the day, at the reception desk or by card in the foyer.</p>

<h2>Cancelling</h2>
<p>Cancel at least 48 hours before the start of the booking and nothing is charged. Later cancellations are charged for the first hour.</p>

<h2>Leaving the room</h2>
<p>Leave the room as you found it: chairs stacked, tables wiped and rubbish in the bins by the kitchen. The building closes at 22:00.</p>

<h2>Safety</h2>
<p>The organiser is responsible for the group's safety while in the building. Fire exits are signed in every room; the assembly point is the car park on Quay Street.</p>
